28
00:03:16.988 --> 00:03:19.824
{\an8}LET THE HOLY WATER WASH THE SINS
AND PROTECT FROM EVIL SPIRITS. AMEN.

29
00:03:22.493 --> 00:03:24.829
Evil spirits want to separate us from God

30
