00:50:44.750 --> 00:50:45.667
Simply incredible!

788
00:50:45.751 --> 00:50:47.169
I have only one wish.

789
00:50:47.252 --> 00:50:49.296
May this peace last forever.

790
00:51:00.557 --> 00:51:02.184
Go work on your performance.

791
00:51:02.809 --> 00:51:05.896
Useless and annoying people.

792
00:51:05.979 --> 00:51:07.355
You never believe me.

793
00:51:07.439 --> 00:51:10.233
He was once a man himself.
He wasn't always a demon.

794
00:51:11.318 --> 00:51:13.653
I bet he was handsome in person.

795
00:51:16.490 --> 00:51:19.201
So who is she?

796
00:51:20.494 --> 00:51:21.870
Oh, my tea!

797
00:51:22.871 --> 00:51:24.414
Has she already left the hotel?

798
00:51:35.133 --> 00:51:36.259
I should know that.

799
00:51:36.343 --> 00:51:38.178
But Su An and her quirks.

800
00:51:43.350 --> 00:51:44.851
I haven't been here for a long time.

801
00:52:00.325 --> 00:52:01.326
<i>To Hee!</i>

802
00:52:07.916 --> 00:52:09.584
Hurry up, To Hee!

803
00:52:15.841 --> 00:52:18.301
I really wanted to stay at home today.

804
00:52:18.385 --> 00:52:20.720
Are you starting to avoid us already?

805
00:52:20.804 --> 00:52:22.013
It hurts me.

806
00:52:22.097 --> 00:52:23.348
don't you have friends

807
00:52:23.431 --> 00:52:24.683
Better spend time with them.

808
00:52:25.600 --> 00:52:27.853
No, he has no friends.

809
00:52:27.936 --> 00:52:29.938
That's why we should spend time with him.

810
00:52:31.231 --> 00:52:33.567
But we are nothing
we can't do it because it's raining.

811
00:52:33.650 --> 00:52:35.110
Don't worry.

812
00:52:35.944 --> 00:52:37.195
It's just a short shower.

813
00:52:37.279 --> 00:52:38.405
It will end soon.

814
00:52:44.244 --> 00:52:45.996
Look, the rain has stopped!

815
00:52:48.206 --> 00:52:50.000
- Shall we go back? Ahead!
- Forward!

816
00:53:03.972 --> 00:53:06.725
I remember you wherever I go.

817
00:53:08.810 --> 00:53:10.520
How should I live?

818
00:53:14.065 --> 00:53:17.819
It had to be
so hardworking and diligent?

819
00:53:20.488 --> 00:53:22.449
It had to be
perfect parents?

820
00:53:51.311 --> 00:53:53.396
Today is surprisingly quiet.

821
00:53:55.565 --> 00:53:56.858
Something wrong.

822
00:54:41.444 --> 00:54:43.071
It's finally over.

823
00:54:44.489 --> 00:54:45.865
It's my damn birthday.

824
00:54:54.749 --> 00:54:57.043
Give Did you call the driver?

825
00:54:59.879 --> 00:55:01.548
- Yes.
- Of course.

826
00:55:18.857 --> 00:55:20.692
{\an8}LANDING PLACE: TONTE BEACH

827
00:55:20.775 --> 00:55:23.111
17 MINUTES
YOUR DRIVER: LEE TAE SU

828
00:55:56.394 --> 00:55:57.687
Who sent you?

829
00:56:08.406 --> 00:56:10.325
Wrong question.

830
00:56:11.159 --> 00:56:13.036
It would be better to ask why.

831
00:56:14.037 --> 00:56:15.038
Don't you think so?

832
00:56:20.168 --> 00:56:22.253
Don't want to know why you will die?

833
00:56:29.844 --> 00:56:31.679
You will die through

834
00:56:32.180 --> 00:56:33.473
Choo Jung Suk.

835
00:57:11.261 --> 00:57:14.639
Where can my booty be today?

836
00:57:21.646 --> 00:57:22.772
<i>Someone is so desperate,</i>

837
00:57:23.815 --> 00:57:25.024
so lonely

838
00:57:25.733 --> 00:57:27.444
and scared

839
00:57:28.403 --> 00:57:31.906
who would not hesitate to take my hand.

840
00:57:53.678 --> 00:57:54.762
Found

841
00:58:15.658 --> 00:58:16.826
Please help…

842
00:58:30.048 --> 00:58:31.174
Jung Koo Won?

843
00:58:35.970 --> 00:58:38.264
<i>What is he doing here?</i>

844
00:58:47.106 --> 00:58:48.149
<i>Is it possible that he</i>

845
00:58:49.442 --> 00:58:50.443
<i>together with him?</i>

846
00:59:02.205 --> 00:59:04.582
<i>No, they are not together.</i>

847
00:59:12.549 --> 00:59:14.592
<i>My life seems to be enveloped in a haze.</i>

848
00:59:15.260 --> 00:59:17.804
<i>Who is a friend and who is an enemy?</i>

849
00:59:18.638 --> 00:59:21.891
<i>Am I surrounded only by enemies?</i>

850
00:59:21.975 --> 00:59:23.184
<i>I can't make it out.</i>

851
00:59:24.686 --> 00:59:26.771
<i>When I can't trust</i>

852
00:59:26.854 --> 00:59:28.731
<i>nothing and no one,</i>

853
00:59:29.857 --> 00:59:31.276
<i>I can only</i>

854
00:59:32.402 --> 00:59:35.405
<i>rely on yourself.</i>

855
00:59:47.417 --> 00:59:48.251
Help me.

856
00:59:51.045 --> 00:59:52.630
This time you ask?

857
00:59:52.714 --> 00:59:53.965
Yes, please help.

858
00:59:55.300 --> 00:59:56.384
OK.

859
00:59:57.343 --> 00:59:59.762
But first we have to make a deal.

860
01:00:00.346 --> 01:00:03.308
Don't you see he has a knife?

861
01:00:03.891 --> 01:00:05.977
Now is definitely the right time
negotiate a deal?

862
01:00:08.563 --> 01:00:10.273
Everything in the world has its price.

863
01:00:12.859 --> 01:00:13.776
OK.

864
01:00:13.860 --> 01:00:14.986
What is the matter?

865
01:00:15.069 --> 01:00:17.822
There is a lot to discuss.
Do you really want to discuss now?

866
01:00:17.905 --> 01:00:20.158
We're not exactly having a tea party here, are we?

867
01:00:20.241 --> 01:00:23.119
It would be crazy to leave
on agreement without information.

868
01:00:24.704 --> 01:00:25.580
As you wish

869
01:00:26.080 --> 01:00:28.499
OK! I will be crazy.

870
01:00:30.460 --> 01:00:34.213
It would be crazy to help you until
how do you sign the agreement

871
01:00:35.882 --> 01:00:37.383
but that man scares me.

872
01:02:08.224 --> 01:02:09.142
Agov.

873
01:02:17.233 --> 01:02:18.901
Did you forget about our agreement?

874
01:04:44.422 --> 01:04:47.008
<i>I have to let go if I want to survive.</i>

875
01:05:04.775 --> 01:05:05.902
<i>Ku Vone.</i>

876
01:05:06.819 --> 01:05:09.071
<i>It's all because of the name, which means "salvation."</i>

877
01:06:00.414 --> 01:06:01.457
There is none.

878
01:06:07.171 --> 01:06:08.464
We managed to survive.

879
01:06:18.432 --> 01:06:19.517
I thought that really...

880
01:07:27.460 --> 01:07:30.129
MY BELOVED DEMON

881
01:08:05.498 --> 01:08:06.665
What kind of tattoo sticker is this?

882
01:08:06.749 --> 01:08:08.292
- "Sticker tattoo"?
<i>- Does not erase.</i>

883
01:08:08.918 --> 01:08:11.128
It is now on your wrist,
but this is my dad.

884
01:08:11.212 --> 01:08:12.129
{\an8}Are you crazy?

885
01:08:12.213 --> 01:08:13.589
{\an8}<i>Crazy To To Hee.</i>

886
01:08:13.672 --> 01:08:16.634
{\an8}<i>Chairman Chu "Mire Group"
sheltered the orphan To To Hee.</i>

887
01:08:16.717 --> 01:08:19.553
{\an8}You will die because of Choo Jung Suk.

888
01:08:19.637 --> 01:08:21.263
{\an8}Are you sure you're not hiding anything?

889
01:08:21.347 --> 01:08:23.307
{\an8}I can't go to heaven, can I?

890
01:08:23.390 --> 01:08:25.810
{\an8}<i>I am completely apathetic
and I feel as if I have become different.</i>

891
01:08:25.893 --> 01:08:27.436
{\an8}<i>I have never felt this way before.</i>

892
01:08:27.520 --> 01:08:29.772
{\an8}<i>So without your strength you will simply burn?</i>

893
01:08:29.855 --> 01:08:31.232
{\an8}<i>I have a lot of time.</i>

894
01:08:31.315 --> 01:08:32.691
{\an8}<i>What can you do without your power?</i>

895
01:08:32.775 --> 01:08:34.527
{\an8}<i>I will do what I do best.</i>

896
01:08:34.610 --> 01:08:36.445
{\an8}<i>Charm people.</i>

897
01:08:39.323 --> 01:08:44.328
Translation of subtitles: Daria Hochel

